<BaseLayout title="Submit your live music event | LiveDiscover"><section class="container page-section"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">For the ones making the noise</p><h1>Your show.<br/><i>Our neighborhood.</i></h1><p>Independent artist? Local promoter? A room with a story?<br/>Tell us what you’re planning. Good music belongs on the map.</p></div><div class="content-grid"><SubmitForm client:load/><aside class="detail-sidebar"><h2>A great night starts here.</h2><p style="font-size:13px">A few good details make a show easier to discover.</p><div class="submit-explainer"><h3>01. Share the essentials.</h3><p>Who’s playing, where, when, and how to get in. Clear details help people choose their night.</p><h3>02. Give it a little color.</h3><p>A good description and original artwork tell people what makes your show worth going out for.</p><h3>03. Keep it yours.</h3><p>Use your own artwork and make sure you have permission to share the information.</p></div><div class="info-banner">This is a working demo form. It validates your details and saves a draft locally. Editorial review and email delivery require connected services.</div></aside></div></section></BaseLayout>
